WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.495 --> 00:00:06.151
(upbeat, lighthearted music)

00:00:06.151 --> 00:00:08.901
- Have we had Vietnamese noodles?

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.055
- I am Vietnamese and
I've had quite a few.

00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:13.283
- I've definitely never had pho,

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:15.776
and when I tell people that,
especially in LA, they gasp.

00:00:15.776 --> 00:00:17.666
- Let's try some noods!

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:20.331
(easy music)

00:00:20.331 --> 00:00:22.082
- [Men, Beanie And Glasses] Aw, damn.

00:00:22.082 --> 00:00:23.267
- Smells like home.

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:24.354
- So is this pho?

00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:26.510
- Yeah, it's pho.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.474
- This is the most delightful hot tub.

00:00:28.474 --> 00:00:30.949
Like I could just swim
in this and drink it.

00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:32.699
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.426
- [Man] Do you pho-cks with it?

00:00:34.426 --> 00:00:36.530
- I do pho-cks with it.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:37.778
- I'm living right now.

00:00:37.778 --> 00:00:38.769
- Beef tripe.

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:40.994
- Ooh, that's intestinal lining.

00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:43.852
Mm, it's like eating
tender strands of a wallet.

00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:45.049
- It's a very clean broth.

00:00:45.049 --> 00:00:46.666
It's just a good way to, like, fix you up

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:48.324
after you've had too much to drink.

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:50.311
- Or if you get too pho-cked up,

00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:52.348
pho-ll yourself up in the morning.

00:00:52.348 --> 00:00:54.777
(upbeat music)

00:00:54.777 --> 00:00:56.228
- [Beanie] This looks fuckin' delicious.

00:00:56.228 --> 00:00:58.195
- It comes with an egg
roll? I'll take six.

00:00:58.195 --> 00:00:59.976
- We were missing one key ingredient.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:02.437
- Fish sauce.
- Ooh, that's dank.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.238
- Kind of smells like a vet.

00:01:04.238 --> 00:01:06.305
- So that's the thing about
a lot of Vietnamese dishes.

00:01:06.305 --> 00:01:08.802
We just love to stuff
our dishes with veggies

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.120
and it kind of balances everything out.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.842
It's a little symphony in your mouth.

00:01:12.842 --> 00:01:15.277
- No, my finger, my
finger went in the sauce!

00:01:15.277 --> 00:01:16.317
- Oh my god.

00:01:16.317 --> 00:01:17.972
- Mm, that pork is good.

00:01:17.972 --> 00:01:19.039
Did you try that pork yet?

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:20.007
- [Green shirt] Mm-mm.

00:01:20.007 --> 00:01:20.907
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:20.907 --> 00:01:23.214
- It's tender, it's flavorful.

00:01:23.214 --> 00:01:25.104
- I feel like the fish
sauce is really imperative.

00:01:25.104 --> 00:01:27.114
It just kinda, like,
weaves everything together

00:01:27.114 --> 00:01:28.864
in a really good way.

00:01:32.977 --> 00:01:35.227
(grunting)

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.109
(bouncing music)

00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:39.188
- [Beanie] You say 'boom away'?

00:01:39.188 --> 00:01:40.225
- [Off-Screen Man] Bún Bò Huế.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:45.082
(start singing 'The Lion Sleeps
Tonight' by Solomon Linda)

00:01:45.082 --> 00:01:46.093
- It's so festive.

00:01:46.093 --> 00:01:49.926
- It's a lot of depth and
spice in it, it's really good.

00:01:49.926 --> 00:01:52.336
- The fuck is that?

00:01:52.336 --> 00:01:54.164
- That's not a lot.
- You don't need a lot.

00:01:54.164 --> 00:01:55.402
- Alright, so we mix it in.

00:01:55.402 --> 00:01:57.335
I think the shrimp taste
actually changed the game.

00:01:57.335 --> 00:01:58.575
- It is more complicated,

00:01:58.575 --> 00:02:00.550
but I don't know if I like it more,

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.029
because my mouth is on fire.

00:02:03.029 --> 00:02:05.048
- The soup is a little spicy.

00:02:05.048 --> 00:02:08.523
- I'm trying to stay calm,
but it's very spicy for me.

00:02:08.523 --> 00:02:10.041
- No, no, you just made me laugh and it,

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:11.593
like, shot up to the back of my nose.

00:02:11.593 --> 00:02:13.096
- Oh no.
- It's so spicy I'm dead.

00:02:13.096 --> 00:02:14.306
- Oh no.

00:02:14.306 --> 00:02:16.556
(sniffing)

00:02:17.676 --> 00:02:19.926
(laughing)

00:02:21.542 --> 00:02:22.531
- They're all my favorite

00:02:22.531 --> 00:02:24.900
but pho will always have a
special place in my heart.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.872
- I'm very happy I finally got to try pho,

00:02:26.872 --> 00:02:28.201
I will be ordering it the next time

00:02:28.201 --> 00:02:29.753
I go way too hard at the club.

00:02:29.753 --> 00:02:31.885
- We're not gonna start a
GoFundMe but someone else can,

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:34.346
it's called the 'Bring Zach
and Kieth to Vietnam fund'.

00:02:34.346 --> 00:02:36.095
We will come, we will
eat all your noodles.

00:02:36.095 --> 00:02:37.233
Thanks, we'll see you there.

00:02:37.233 --> 00:02:41.176
- And the description of the
event is pho-ck Ned and Eugene.

00:02:41.176 --> 00:02:42.564
- Fuckin' nailed it.

00:02:42.564 --> 00:02:45.064
(poppy music)

